<BaseLayout title="Privacy Policy | BK Accounting and Tax LLC" description="Website privacy information for BK Accounting and Tax LLC."><section class="section"><div class="container legal-copy"><p class="eyebrow">Privacy</p><h1>Privacy Policy</h1><p><strong>Launch draft — professional legal review recommended before production release.</strong></p><p><strong>Last updated:</strong> August 14, 2026</p><h2>Information you choose to provide</h2><p>When website contact or scheduling features are enabled, BK Accounting and Tax LLC may receive information you choose to provide, such as your name, phone number, email address, service interest, appointment details, and message.</p><h2>Sensitive financial and tax information</h2><p>Please do not submit Social Security numbers, tax returns, tax documents, banking credentials, account passwords, payment-card information, or other highly sensitive financial information through a general website form or ordinary email. We will provide an appropriate secure method when sensitive documents are required.</p><h2>How information may be used</h2><p>Information you provide may be used to respond to your inquiry, schedule or manage a consultation, communicate about requested services, maintain business records, protect the website and communications from abuse, and meet applicable legal or professional obligations.</p><h2>Third-party services</h2><p>The website may use third-party providers for hosting, scheduling, analytics, spam prevention, security, or communications. Those providers may process information according to their own terms and privacy practices. This policy must be updated to identify material services actually enabled at launch.</p><h2>Website data and cookies</h2><p>Hosting and security providers may automatically receive technical information such as IP address, browser type, device information, and request logs. If optional analytics or advertising cookies are added in the future, the website privacy notice and consent controls should be updated before those tools are activated.</p><h2>Data retention and security</h2><p>We aim to retain website inquiry information only as long as reasonably needed for business, legal, security, and recordkeeping purposes. No method of internet transmission or electronic storage is completely secure, so sensitive records should be exchanged only through an approved secure channel.</p><h2>Your questions</h2><p>Questions about website privacy may be sent to <a href="mailto:belete@bkaccountingtax.com">belete@bkaccountingtax.com</a> or by calling <a href="tel:+12405647724">+1 240-564-7724</a>.</p></div></section></BaseLayout><style>.legal-copy{max-width:850px}.legal-copy h1{font-size:clamp(2.6rem,5vw,4.5rem)}.legal-copy h2{font-size:1.8rem;margin-top:2.2rem}</style>